The game "Destroy" is a quick and simple Kill Kill Kill type game.

The whole purpose and point to this game is to build your character up as
high as you possibly can, while maintaining a lead against your oponents.
To do so, simply kill everything and everyone you can. Sounds simple, but is
it?

In addition to just raising levels, you raise your rank. To raise your rank
you must complete a quest. There are 9 quests. Upon completing the 9th
quest, you will be appointed king.

This game is meant to be fast, quick, and easy. There isn't much special
about it, except the terminology I used. The following explains:

Name: Your character's name.
 Lvl: The experience level of your character.
  GP: Gold pieces.
 Exp: Experience.
Need: How much Exp is needed to get to the next level.
  HP: Hit Points.
 MAX: Maximum HP.
 Str: Strength.
 Def: Defense.
  WL: Weapon Level.
  AL: Armor Level.
  BP: Battle Power. Total of Str+WL.
  BD: Battle Defense. Total of Def+AL.

And without further ado, I present you this marvelously easy game. Enjoy.

One last note: Good luck! If you die more times than you current level,
your character will be rerolled (deleted). Watch it! And be careful!

Tips:
Don't worry too much about saving up GP. Just heal as much as you can, as
often as you can. Eventually, you will be able to save up enough to buy
better weapons and armor, but there is no rush on this. My level 500+
character has only level 70 Weapon and Armor, so, as you can see, the
advancements through equipment is much slower than all the other stats.
